From d000b3d423fcbfee4cc68a21ffff04f3a02ce2b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhengshsh <zss@zhengshshdeMacBook-Air.local>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:16:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat: submission/evaluation limits, community visibility
 scopes, free-form posts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- assignment gains max_submissions (default 5) and max_evaluations (default 3),
  editable in 作业管理 with 0 = unlimited; submit() and evaluate() enforce them
- editor shows 已提交 n/N and disables 提交评审 once exhausted
- publication gains visibility (COURSE|PUBLIC); author opts in to public at
  request time; /publications?scope=COURSE|MINE|PUBLIC powers the community switch
- free-form posts: POST /courses/{cid}/free-entries creates a standalone entry
  backed by a hidden free_form assignment row so existing joins stay intact;
  posts are visible only to their author, submitted through the normal review flow
- rubric version no longer surfaces on assignment cards, reader, grading or the
  editor; it stays in 课程量规 and the export report
